        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the Energy Storage segment, we own and operate grid-connected, stand alone In Front of the Meter (IFM) BESS facilities, which provide capacity, energy and ancillary services directly to the electric grid.",
        "start_character": 2963,
        "end_character": 3170
      },
      {
