        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since 2004, we have established strong business relationships in the Turkish geothermal market and provided our wide range of solutions, including our binary systems, to over 40 geothermal power plants with a total capacity of over 900MW and 96 MW under construction.",
